  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58a07a2da95433f45940c6d5cc77769d, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 42017882112
    m_Localized: You spot a chest hidden in the middle of the forest. What can it
      contain?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 616092270592
    m_Localized: You stumble upon a magic well. Perhaps you should exchange something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1025624113152
    m_Localized: A merchant is waving at you. It seems he has something to sell !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2027735613440
    m_Localized: In the middle of the forest, you come across a campfire. Nobody
      seems to be nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2833209753600
    m_Localized: You find your SENSEI meditating ! Should you attempt a surprise
      attack ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3172851908608
    m_Localized: You see a suspicious chest with traces of blood on it. Should you
      open it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 365643294965760
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 365734563020800
    m_Localized: Rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 365905086644224
    m_Localized: Trade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 366355961741312
    m_Localized: Exchange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 366541219954688
    m_Localized: Open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 366679061561344
    m_Localized: Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1858138042400768
    m_Localized: "You wake up in better shape. It\u2019s time to continue your journey."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2152000212303872
    m_Localized: When you wake up, you find a note stating 'TOO SLOW' and some of
      your money is gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2151991525900288
    m_Localized: It was not meditation, but a nap. You still take his purse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2663634894716928
    m_Localized: What a boon ! The chest contained equipment you can use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3315097107038208
    m_Localized: It's unfortunate that you don't have anything to exchange. The only
      thing left is to go back...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3315065280659456
    m_Localized: Due to the exchange, the well's power was reduced. Did you get a
      valuable item back ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3388065883488256
    m_Localized: 'ATK:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3388162688024576
    m_Localized: 'DEF:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3388217415303168
    m_Localized: 'SPD:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3388267147165696
    m_Localized: 'LCK:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3676737904181248
    m_Localized: Aaaaargh ! You have fallen into the mimic trap. Curiosity is a nasty
      flaw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3676735832195072
    m_Localized: You find very good quality equipment. Sometimes curiosity pays off
      !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3965890977988608
    m_Localized: Observe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3965972251017216
    m_Localized: "Isn\u2019t this one of those famous monster hunters ?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3967084085510144
    m_Localized: You are very impressed by what you have just seen !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3967072962215936
    m_Localized: Not so strong apparently. You take his equipment as a memento.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5133538059223040
    m_Localized: Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5133707337138176
    m_Localized: Coney
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5961905566253056
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5961904056303616
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5961902240169984
    m_Localized: Select
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6209713250631680
    m_Localized: After you're done shopping. You greet the merchant and resume your
      journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6343488768966656
    m_Localized: SOLD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
